From 36dc82154e9eceef64fc7ee3ecb5cfe1259587c9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 22:49:31 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] www: Security Review bulk select, sortable lists, the
 existing pages on the kit

Firewall: Security Review select-several (checkbox column, select-all, one bar
of actions, one request per Accept) and the protection rows. Devices and
Gatekeeper: sortable columns through the kit sorter; Gatekeeper takes the
connection type from the Devices data (MLO, wired, band). Connections: the
detail panel keeps its width on long names. Dreadwatch: free lists, the name
limit and the lists left out, removable never-block names. Firmware: a refused
upload is reported. Storage: the Wallguard, Dreadwatch and Encrypted DNS rows.
Wi-Fi Settings: Roaming Assistant can be switched off (the hidden input carrying
0 was skipped by Apply) and a schedule edit stays in Apply. reaper_shell.asp:
frames .asp pages only, marks a menu page a page opens by itself, polls less,
no jQuery. The dashboard, QoS and WAN Ports pages share the kit's styles.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
